# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 9.2 Slope
d.sec('9.2-slope')
b('Define the inclination and slope of a line.', 'Inclination θ = angle the line makes with the positive x-axis, measured anticlockwise, 0° ≤ θ < 180°. Slope ' + T('m = tan θ') + ' (θ ≠ 90°)')
