b('Example 8: intercepts −3 and 2.', 'x/(−3) + y/2 = 1 → ' + N('2x − 3y + 6 = 0'))
b('Ex 9.2 Q1–3: equations of the axes; through (−4, 3) with slope ½; through the origin with slope m.', N('y = 0') + ' and ' + N('x = 0') + ';  y − 3 = (x + 4)/2 → ' + N('x − 2y + 10 = 0') + ';  ' + N('y = mx'))
b('Ex 9.2 Q5–6: x-intercept 3 units left of the origin, slope −2; y-intercept 2 above the origin at 30°.', N('2x + y + 6 = 0') + ';  y = x/√3 + 2 → ' + N('x − √3y + 2√3 = 0'))
b('Ex 9.2 Q7: line through (−1, 1) and (2, −4).', 'slope −5/3 → ' + N('5x + 3y + 2 = 0'))
b('Ex 9.2 Q8: median through R in triangle P(2,1), Q(−2,3), R(4,5).', 'Midpoint of PQ = (0, 2); slope (5 − 2)/4 = 3/4 → ' + N('3x − 4y + 8 = 0'))
