b('Ex 9.3 Q6–7: ∥ to 3x − 4y + 2 = 0 through (−2, 3); ⟂ to x − 7y + 5 = 0 with x-intercept 3.', N('3x − 4y + 18 = 0') + ';  slope −7: y = −7(x − 3) → ' + N('7x + y − 21 = 0'))
